{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, this is a real wizard game! Here, you are a wizard hiding in a modern city, chanting spells to compete with other \u201cwizards\u201d in this world. Defeat your opponents to claim the final victory!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1 Online Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use matchmaking or invite your friends to duel as your battle partners. Meet other \u201cmages\u201d in your world and see if you can take them down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/edcc29d899bc239ae60c5eafa604c969.poster.avif?t=1772507771\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/edcc29d899bc239ae60c5eafa604c969.webm?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/edcc29d899bc239ae60c5eafa604c969.mp4?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Visuals</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield dozens of powerful, spectacular spells and fully immerse yourself in a day in the life of a mighty wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/3a0a0b7d41f7e7509713dc62b5fe2f41.poster.avif?t=1772507771\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/3a0a0b7d41f7e7509713dc62b5fe2f41.webm?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/3a0a0b7d41f7e7509713dc62b5fe2f41.mp4?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speak, and Magic Happens</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s right\u2014real wizards don\u2019t need keyboards. They cast by chanting! Here, your voice is your strongest weapon: use it to unleash spells and even interrupt your opponent\u2019s casting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/3a6e1b2a33b05c782ca28ca46bfe2738.poster.avif?t=1772507771\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/3a6e1b2a33b05c782ca28ca46bfe2738.webm?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/3a6e1b2a33b05c782ca28ca46bfe2738.mp4?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Schools of Spells, Mix and Match</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match brings a selection of spell cards from your deck. Fire, Water, Dark, Light, and Spirit\u2014five schools of magic that offer rich strategies and dramatic turnarounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/096cee9657d788877ce767a9af4b94ad.poster.avif?t=1772507771\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/096cee9657d788877ce767a9af4b94ad.webm?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/096cee9657d788877ce767a9af4b94ad.mp4?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Both Opponent and Partner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside of the battle, you can high-five each other or even play rock\u2013paper\u2013scissors! And if your opponent allows it, you can hear them chanting their spells during the duel~</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/ca89b0bedba52dc234041c834db19d14.poster.avif?t=1772507771\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/ca89b0bedba52dc234041c834db19d14.webm?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/ca89b0bedba52dc234041c834db19d14.mp4?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955960?t=1772507771","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/6770f8735eebfc6064a4c5f51ecf1e7c2ef26d45/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772507771","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/5623b93bdf87e09c7108ea14a07246ae3312200f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772507771","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/5623b93bdf87e09c7108ea14a07246ae3312200f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772507771","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4259310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hey, this is a real wizard game! Here, you are a wizard hiding in a modern city, chanting spells to compete with other \u201cwizards\u201d in this world. Defeat your opponents to claim the final victory!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1v1 Online Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use matchmaking or invite your friends to duel as your battle partners. Meet other \u201cmages\u201d in your world and see if you can take them down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/edcc29d899bc239ae60c5eafa604c969.poster.avif?t=1772507771\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/edcc29d899bc239ae60c5eafa604c969.webm?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/edcc29d899bc239ae60c5eafa604c969.mp4?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Visuals</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield dozens of powerful, spectacular spells and fully immerse yourself in a day in the life of a mighty wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/3a0a0b7d41f7e7509713dc62b5fe2f41.poster.avif?t=1772507771\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/3a0a0b7d41f7e7509713dc62b5fe2f41.webm?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/3a0a0b7d41f7e7509713dc62b5fe2f41.mp4?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speak, and Magic Happens</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s right\u2014real wizards don\u2019t need keyboards. They cast by chanting! Here, your voice is your strongest weapon: use it to unleash spells and even interrupt your opponent\u2019s casting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/3a6e1b2a33b05c782ca28ca46bfe2738.poster.avif?t=1772507771\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/3a6e1b2a33b05c782ca28ca46bfe2738.webm?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/3a6e1b2a33b05c782ca28ca46bfe2738.mp4?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Schools of Spells, Mix and Match</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match brings a selection of spell cards from your deck. Fire, Water, Dark, Light, and Spirit\u2014five schools of magic that offer rich strategies and dramatic turnarounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/096cee9657d788877ce767a9af4b94ad.poster.avif?t=1772507771\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/096cee9657d788877ce767a9af4b94ad.webm?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/096cee9657d788877ce767a9af4b94ad.mp4?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Both Opponent and Partner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside of the battle, you can high-five each other or even play rock\u2013paper\u2013scissors! And if your opponent allows it, you can hear them chanting their spells during the duel~</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/ca89b0bedba52dc234041c834db19d14.poster.avif?t=1772507771\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/ca89b0bedba52dc234041c834db19d14.webm?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/extras/ca89b0bedba52dc234041c834db19d14.mp4?t=1772507771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Spiritx2 Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955960/6821476156f0214e1e8f61176b8887023cb7178c/header.jpg?t=1772507771","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3955960/1134883381/210d5460c7f86a5412981f4cd4cede6162bf1b18/1769685321/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769686072","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3955960/1134883381/210d5460c7f86a5412981f4cd4cede6162bf1b18/1769685321/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769686072","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3955960/1134883381/210d5460c7f86a5412981f4cd4cede6162bf1b18/1769685321/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769686072","id":257225730,"name":"Chant Wizard _ Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257225730/226912392a272c436b309095bba07974d017cfdf/movie_600x337.jpg?t=176